'''Machamp ex''' (Japanese: '''カイリキーex''' ''Kairiky ex'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

