==Trivia==
The special illustration rare card portrays the same scene as the illustration rare card of {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Alakazam|236}} from the same set, but from a different angle.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Machamp}}.
*{{m|Mega Punch}} is a move in the Pokémon games that Machamp can learn via [[TM]] or [[Move Tutor]].

